    "description_html": "<p><span>A push-button plastic ballpoint with a colored rubberized grip, white barrel and chrome trim. It's part of our <a href=\"../../../../pens/contour-pens/\">custom contour pens</a> range at Custom Genie.</span></p>\n<p>Our best-selling printed pen!</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Full color, high-resolution digital printing</li>\n<li>Large, full-color digital print area</li>\n<li>White barrel with chrome trim</li>\n<li>Choose from 5 different rubberized grip&nbsp;colors</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Specs:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Digital print area: 60 x 6mm</li>\n<li>Writing ink color: Black</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>No setup fees. No design fees!</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
